  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DIAGNOSTIC CENTERS PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE MAIN OBJECTIVE OF THE PROJECT IS TO STRENGTHEN THE DIAGNOSTIC CAPABILITY OF THE MEDICAL SYSTEM AND TO CONTINUE THE IMPROVEMENT OF THE DELIVERY OF QUALITY HEALTH CARE AT VELAYAT(DISTRICT) LEVEL. THE PROJECT WILL ESTABLISH TWO DIAGNOSTIC CENTERS, ONE IN ASHGABOT AND OTHER AT DOSHOGUZ. EACH ONE WILL PROVIDE MEDICAL EQUIPMENT.</narrative>
  </description>
